After an entirely-too-long break from NH, I finally picked the game
back up earlier this year. I hadn't played since some point release of
3.2, so it took me a while to get used to a lot of the new stuff. And
of course, plenty of YASDs along the way, mostly for things that I
should have known better about. For instance, I had a "sure" first
3.4.3 ascension cut short by a kraken in Rodney's moat, and another by
a plain ol' cockatrice stoning. (Not even something fun, like having
something destroy my gloves while I was wielding said rubber
chicken...it just hissed at me and I was too slow in the head to chomp
one of my lizard corpses.)

But I finally had my first ascension in August, and another one
recently. So without further ado...

